   "why": "A domestic procedure for challenging the election result existed and was used; what it lacked were the safeguards that would have made it effective, and para 117 holds the violation of Article 13 in conjunction with Article 3 of Protocol No. 1. The failing is effectiveness rather than the absence of any remedy."
